ACADEMIC ATTRIBUTION

This software is an implementation of the secret-key generation method 
proposed in the following academic research:

Y. Hua, "A Remark on the AAA Method for Secret-Key Generation in 
Mobile Networks," IEEE Wireless Communications Letters, Dec. 2025.

The theoretical AAA method and its underlying cryptographic concepts 
remain the intellectual property of the original author as published 
in IEEE WCL. Any use of this software in academic or research 
publications must cite the original paper.
